 "title": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang ka ISTIFA! Kya hua, kyun hua? | Breaking #shorts",
 "description": "Nvidia ke CEO Jensen Huang ne 12 Nov 2026 ko CEO pad aur board se turant istifa diya.\n- 8 Nov: staff ko email mein maana ki patni ke prati bewafa rahe, maafi maangi\n- Report (NYT): ek rishta aisi businesswoman se jis par US agencies ko Chini jasoos hone ka shak - China ne aarop bebuniyad bataye\n- Nvidia: kampani ki jaankari mein raaz bahar nahi gaye, jaanch jaari\n- CFO Colette Kress interim CEO\n- Share 12 Nov ko ek samay 14% se zyada gira, ~4% neeche band\n\nSources:\nhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001045810/000104581026000082/nvidiaannouncesceotransiti.htm\nhttps://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/12/why-did-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-resign-and-who-is-colette-kress\nhttps://www.pbs.org/newshour/nation/what-we-know-after-jensen-huangs-resignation-as-nvidias-ceo\n\nPhotos (Wikimedia Commons):\nFile:NVIDIA Headquarters.jpg | Coolcaesar | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:2026-02-12 NVIDIA Quadro 400 HOF6313 RAW-Export.png | PantheraLeo1359531 | CC BY-SA 4.0\nFile:Graphics Card Diamond Viper 330 with Nvidia (RIVA 128) GPU.jpg | Timothy Borkowski | CC BY-SA 3.0\nFile:US Capitol dome Jan 2006.jpg | Diliff | CC BY 2.5\nFile:Nvidia NV40 die shot.jpg | Martijn Boer | Public domain\nFile:Nvidia NV40 die shot - 42318170072.jpg | Martijn Boer | Public domain\nFile:New York Stock Exchange building, 20231002 171816.jpg | Jakub Hałun | CC BY 4.0\nFile:NVidia G71 GPU.jpg | Diego3336 | CC BY 2.0\nFile:Nvidia NV40 die shot - 42318174572.jpg | Martijn Boer | Public domain\n\n#shorts #JensenHuang #Nvidia #NvidiaCEO #BreakingNews #TechNews #hindinews #60seckhabar",
